"<div class=\"ambient-field\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ambient-orbit orbit-one\"></i><i class=\"ambient-orbit orbit-two\"></i><i class=\"ambient-spark spark-one\"></i><i class=\"ambient-spark spark-two\"></i></div><a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\" data-focus-id=\"skip-navigation\">Skip to experience</a><div class=\"shell\"><header class=\"topbar\" data-focus-id=\"portfolio-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"Jérôme Schaeffer — Home\" data-focus-id=\"home-brand\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">js.</span><span class=\"brand-label\">Jérôme Schaeffer<small>Senior product engineer</small></span></a><div class=\"header-right\"><span class=\"location mono\">Seoul, KR <time id=\"seoul-time\"></time></span><button class=\"header-resume\" data-dialog=\"resume\" data-focus-id=\"header-resume\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"detail-dialog\">Résumé ↗</button><button class=\"contact-link\" style=\"background:transparent;padding:0\" data-dialog=\"contact\" data-focus-id=\"persistent-contact\">Let’s talk <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></header><main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-focus-id=\"portfolio-main\"><section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-home\" aria-labelledby=\"home-title\" data-focus-id=\"home\">\n<div class=\"home-grid personal-home\"><div class=\"hero-copy\" data-reveal><p class=\"eyebrow\">Senior product engineer · Seoul</p><h1 class=\"hello\" id=\"home-title\" data-focus-id=\"personal-heading\">Hi, I’m <span class=\"hero-name\">Jérôme</span><span class=\"surname\">Schaeffer.</span></h1><p class=\"intro\">I build the experience.<br>And what makes it work.</p><p class=\"intro-detail\">Product interfaces, backend systems, AI and team delivery. I connect the work people see with the systems and collaboration behind it.</p><div class=\"home-actions\"><a class=\"primary-work\" href=\"#work/3i/live/overview?filter=professional\" data-focus-id=\"home-selected-work\">Explore professional work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-button\" href=\"#playground\" data-focus-id=\"home-approach\">Try the decision demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<figure class=\"home-person\" data-reveal data-focus-id=\"home-portrait\"><div class=\"portrait-composition\" id=\"portrait-composition\"><div class=\"portrait-plane\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><svg class=\"portrait-orbit\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M35 332C-8 247 31 69 163 24C293-20 385 105 369 237C357 333 249 396 125 366\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M47 343C8 258 55 89 168 44C272 2 359 112 348 231\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-opacity=\".3\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"332\" r=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M340 49h18m-9-9v18\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/></svg><img class=\"person-portrait\" src=\"/assets/jerome-portrait.jpeg\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Black-and-white portrait of Jérôme Schaeffer\"><span class=\"portrait-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">SEOUL / KR</span></div><figcaption><span>Based in Seoul.<br>Experience across France, Luxembourg & Korea.</span><a href=\"#about/3i\" data-focus-id=\"home-about\">A little more about me <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"home-selection\" data-reveal aria-label=\"Selected professional experience\"><a href=\"#work/3i\" data-project=\"3i\" data-focus-id=\"home-3i\"><span><strong>3i</strong><small>Senior Frontend Engineer<br>Meet & Cloud UI · CS & Coaches</small></span><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"#work/enhans\" data-project=\"enhans\" data-focus-id=\"home-enhans\"><span><strong>Enhans</strong><small>Frontend development & leadership<br>ACT-1 UI · Model Generator</small></span><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"#work/rubiwin\" data-project=\"rubiwin\" data-focus-id=\"home-rubiwin\"><span><strong>Redspher</strong><small>Team Lead Web Developer<br>Rubiwin & Supplier Portal</small></span><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n</section><section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\" data-focus-id=\"selected-work\" hidden><div class=\"work-head\" data-reveal><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span id=\"work-collection-label\">Selected work / Professional experience</span></p><h2 id=\"work-title\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-focus-id=\"work-heading\">Professional experience.</h2></div><div class=\"gallery-controls\"><div class=\"category-filters\" aria-label=\"Filter projects\"><button class=\"filter-button\" data-filter=\"professional\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-focus-id=\"filter-professional\">Professional <span>03</span></button><button class=\"filter-button\" data-filter=\"independent\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-focus-id=\"filter-independent\">Side projects <span>04</span></button></div><span class=\"mono\" id=\"project-position\">01 / 03</span><button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"previous-project\" aria-label=\"Previous project\" data-focus-id=\"previous-project\">←</button><button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"next-project\" aria-label=\"Next project\" data-focus-id=\"next-project\">→</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"work-layout\" data-reveal><aside class=\"project-index\" aria-label=\"Project selection\" data-focus-id=\"project-index\"><p class=\"filter-label sr-only\">The collection</p><div class=\"project-list\" id=\"project-list\"></div></aside>\n<article class=\"editorial-inspector\" id=\"project-story\" aria-label=\"Project story\" data-focus-id=\"project-inspector\"><p class=\"inspector-kicker\" id=\"inspector-meta\"></p><h3 id=\"inspector-title\" data-focus-id=\"project-heading\"></h3><div class=\"inspector-role\" id=\"inspector-role\"></div><nav class=\"inspector-tabs\" id=\"inspector-tabs\" aria-label=\"Case study sections\"></nav><div class=\"inspector-story\" id=\"inspector-story\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><nav class=\"story-pagination\" aria-label=\"Story pages\"><button id=\"story-previous\" class=\"outline-button\" aria-label=\"Previous story page\" data-focus-id=\"story-previous\">← Previous</button><span id=\"story-position\" class=\"mono\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span><button id=\"story-next\" class=\"outline-button\" aria-label=\"Next story page\" data-focus-id=\"story-next\">Next →</button></nav><a class=\"case-approach\" id=\"case-approach\" data-focus-id=\"case-approach\" href=\"#playground\" hidden></a></article>\n<div class=\"visual-column\" data-focus-id=\"project-visual-column\"><nav class=\"visual-chapters\" id=\"visual-chapters\" aria-label=\"Product chapters\"></nav><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"visual-kind\"></p><div class=\"visual-stage\" id=\"visual-stage\" data-focus-id=\"project-visual\"></div><p class=\"visual-caption\" id=\"visual-caption\"></p><p class=\"visual-annotation\" id=\"visual-annotation\" data-focus-id=\"visual-annotation\"></p></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-playground\" aria-labelledby=\"approach-title\" data-focus-id=\"decision-playground\" hidden>\n<header class=\"decision-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 / How I work</p><h2 id=\"approach-title\" data-focus-id=\"approach-heading\">Where should AI stop?</h2></div><p>I start with the need, shape a useful interaction, and decide where a person stays in control.</p></header>\n<div class=\"evaluation-layout\"><form id=\"decision-form\" class=\"situation-panel\" novalidate data-focus-id=\"situation-form\"><div class=\"example-launcher\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Start with an example · make it yours</p><div class=\"example-cards\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Example situations\"><button type=\"button\" data-example=\"inbox\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><strong>Translation draft</strong><small>Refine the tone</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-example=\"access\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">◎</span><strong>Agent action</strong><small>Change a shared file</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-example=\"refund\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span><strong>Carrier pricing</strong><small>Suggest an offer</small></button></div></div><div class=\"situation-label\"><label for=\"situation\">Bring your own situation.</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-button\" id=\"clear-situation\" data-focus-id=\"clear-situation\">Clear</button></div><textarea id=\"situation\" name=\"situation\" rows=\"5\" maxlength=\"1200\" minlength=\"10\" aria-describedby=\"situation-help character-count situation-error\" placeholder=\"For example: an AI assistant drafts a reply to a customer, but a person reviews it before sending…\" data-focus-id=\"situation-input\"></textarea><div class=\"input-meta\"><span id=\"situation-help\">A hypothetical product decision. 10–1,200 characters.</span><output id=\"character-count\" for=\"situation\">0 / 1,200</output></div><p id=\"situation-error\" class=\"input-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n<select id=\"scenario\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><option value=\"\">Choose an example…</option><option value=\"inbox\">Refine a translation</option><option value=\"access\">Let an agent act</option><option value=\"refund\">Suggest a carrier price</option></select>\n<fieldset class=\"decision-constraints\"><legend>Optional constraints <span>Explore the trade-off</span></legend><div class=\"constraint\"><div class=\"constraint-top\"><label for=\"ambiguity\">Ambiguity</label><output id=\"ambiguity-label\" for=\"ambiguity\">Medium</output></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"ambiguity\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" data-focus-id=\"ambiguity-control\"></div><div class=\"constraint\"><div class=\"constraint-top\"><label for=\"consequences\">Consequences</label><output id=\"consequences-label\" for=\"consequences\">Medium</output></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"consequences\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" data-focus-id=\"consequences-control\"></div><div class=\"constraint\"><div class=\"constraint-top\"><label for=\"reversibility\">Reversibility</label><output id=\"reversibility-label\" for=\"reversibility\">Partly reversible</output></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"reversibility\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" data-focus-id=\"reversibility-control\"></div></fieldset>\n<p class=\"send-note\" id=\"send-note\">Your situation and constraints are sent to OpenAI when you evaluate. Use fictional situations. No actions are executed.</p><div class=\"evaluate-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" id=\"evaluate-situation\" class=\"primary-work\" aria-describedby=\"send-note\" data-focus-id=\"evaluate-situation\">Evaluate situation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"cancel-evaluation\" class=\"outline-button\" data-focus-id=\"cancel-evaluation\" hidden>Cancel request</button></div></form>\n<aside class=\"evaluation-result\" id=\"evaluation-result\" aria-label=\"Evaluation result\" aria-busy=\"false\" data-focus-id=\"evaluation-result\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">OpenAI / Decision</p><div id=\"evaluation-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><h3 id=\"ai-choice\">Your situation.<br>A considered boundary.</h3><p id=\"ai-status\">Describe what AI might do, what could go wrong, and where a person is involved. Then evaluate when you’re ready.</p></div><div class=\"ai-bars\" id=\"ai-bars\" aria-label=\"Model probabilities\" hidden></div><p id=\"ai-note\" class=\"result-note\" hidden></p><div id=\"category-reading\" hidden><p class=\"eyebrow\">How to read this category</p><p id=\"category-meaning\"></p><small>General interpretation, not model reasoning.</small></div><a class=\"example-return\" id=\"example-return\" href=\"#work/3i\" data-focus-id=\"return-to-case\">Explore professional work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></aside></div></section>\n<section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\" data-focus-id=\"career-about\" hidden>\n<div class=\"stage-head\" data-reveal><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">01 / A little background</p><h2 id=\"about-title\" data-focus-id=\"career-heading\">A little more about me.</h2></div><p class=\"stage-note\">A career across products, systems and people.<br>Select a chapter to look closer.</p></div>\n<div class=\"about-layout\"><div class=\"about-person\" data-reveal data-focus-id=\"about-introduction\"><img class=\"person-portrait\" src=\"/assets/jerome-portrait.jpeg\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Black-and-white portrait of Jérôme Schaeffer\"><p>I’m based in Seoul, with experience in France, Luxembourg and Korea.</p><p>I’ve built across frontend, backend and AI, led teams, and taught web development. Each part gives me a wider view of what it takes to deliver a product.</p></div><div class=\"career-layout\" data-reveal><div class=\"chapter-list\" id=\"chapter-list\" aria-label=\"Career chapters\"></div><article class=\"chapter-detail\" id=\"chapter-detail\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-focus-id=\"career-chapter\"><span class=\"chapter-number\" id=\"chapter-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"chapter-date\"></p><h3 id=\"chapter-title\" data-focus-id=\"chapter-heading\"></h3><p class=\"chapter-role\" id=\"chapter-role\"></p><p class=\"chapter-description\" id=\"chapter-description\"></p><button class=\"text-button\" id=\"chapter-project\" data-focus-id=\"chapter-related-work\">Explore related work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></article></div>\n</div><div class=\"career-footer\" data-reveal><p>Based in Seoul. Connecting the product interface to the systems and people behind it.</p><button class=\"text-button\" data-dialog=\"resume\" data-focus-id=\"resume-information\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"detail-dialog\">Read my résumé <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div>\n</section></main><footer class=\"bottom-bar\" data-focus-id=\"persistent-navigation\"><span clas